Ashebophysics

An additive physics-AI benchmark and interface for the Ashebo RGT Hamiltonian
Reference Solver. The original Hamiltonian source is retained without changes.
Implementation and audits developed with OpenAI ChatGPT assistance.
No independent external replication or peer review is implied.

The package uses NumPy, with optional PyTorch, SciPy and Matplotlib dependencies.
Those dependencies retain their own licenses. No upstream Poisson-GENERIC
author notebook is incorporated into this component.
